rule WhatIfScenarioModelling
	lineageTag: 8f0500a6-2292-5c0d-81df-ce71e748654c
	statement: In this dataset revenue and expense amounts are both stored as positive numbers. Scenario Revenue, Scenario Expenses and Scenario Profit apply the selected Revenue Growth and Expense Change percentages to Actuals, and Adjusted Budget measures apply the selected Budget Adjustment percentage to Budget. With no selection the adjustment is 0 percent.
	ruleReferencedEntity BudgetLine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty Amount
		ruleReferencedProperty ScenarioId
